{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","怒隼空袭"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤艾洛娜对当前目标造成伤害，并在场上共同作战。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，布莱恩拥有1000点初始能量，战斗开始时会使得猎隼艾洛娜飞至空中伺机待发。使用终极技能时，立即消耗300 − 80点能量，呼唤艾洛娜对布莱恩当前目标进行俯冲打击，造成320% ATK伤害，随后使得艾洛娜在场上协同作战，每秒消耗能量，且消耗量会随时间逐渐提升，当能量耗尽或布莱恩被击败时，艾洛娜将会离开战场。艾洛娜在战场上无法被攻击，无视地形并且优先攻击布莱恩当前的目标，普通攻击造成90% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":61,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":87,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":195,"end":202,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜持续在场上超过8秒后获得强化，普通攻击伤害提高20%，急速提高40点，强化效果会在艾洛娜离开战场后重置。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜持续在场上超过18秒后获得再次强化，令雷电环绕自身，使得艾洛娜周围1格范围的敌人降低30点急速且每秒受到40% ATK伤害，强化效果会在艾洛娜离开战场后重置。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜的普通攻击伤害提升至100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜的普通攻击伤害提升至110% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","叶刃联击"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","生成魔法飞叶对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生成4枚魔法飞叶，随后向目标快速发射全部魔法飞叶，每枚飞叶造成90% + 10% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每枚飞叶造成伤害提升至93% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每枚飞叶造成伤害提升至96% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每枚飞叶造成伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","掠影闪击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，布莱恩对敌人造成若干次伤害会吸取能量；主动释放时，造成两段伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，布莱恩的普通攻击和技能对敌人造成2次伤害时会吸收其50点能量。主动释放时，布莱恩对敌人造成2次190% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","布莱恩的普通攻击和技能对敌人造成2次伤害时，使艾洛娜的下一次普通攻击变为对敌人释放闪电打击，额外附带敌人当前生命值4% + 0.5%的伤害并造成打断效果，额外伤害最高不超过布莱恩240% + 15%的攻击力。该效果最多可以储存3次。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":93,"end":99,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":72,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时每次造成伤害提升至195% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时每次造成伤害提升至200% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，艾洛娜在场上期间进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高10点急速。且当艾洛娜在场上期间，额外提升3点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高13点急速。且当艾洛娜在场上期间，额外提升4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高17点急速。且当艾洛娜在场上期间，额外提升5点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","一心同体"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","布莱恩受到控制效果或者单次高额伤害时，艾洛娜对敌人造成高额伤害和眩晕；艾洛娜在布莱恩受到最后一击时保护其不被击败。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜在场上时才能触发，当敌人对布莱恩施加控制效果或单次造成超过布莱恩15%最大生命值的伤害时，艾洛娜立即冲到该敌人身前，对其造成350% ATK伤害并使其眩晕，持续3秒，该效果每20秒最多生效1次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当布莱恩首次受到最后一击时，艾洛娜消耗所有能量立即返回布莱恩身边为其抵挡此次伤害，恢复200% ATK的生命值，并展开终极庇护，在接下来5秒内，布莱恩无法被选中，且每秒恢复40% ATK的生命值。艾洛娜随后离场并在10秒内无法被召唤。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜的反击伤害提升至400% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜的反击伤害提升至450% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放“叶刃联击”时在艾洛娜身边额外生成飞叶。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放“叶刃联击”时若艾洛娜在场上，还会在其身边额外生成2枚飞叶。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","艾洛娜的闪电打击会额外传导给目标2格范围内最近的其他2名敌人，且当艾洛娜的普通攻击或技能对敌人造成3次伤害时，立即使布莱恩永久提升15点急速，至多通过该效果提升120点急速。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","苍羽披风"]]}